# --- CLion: the IDE state is local, the run configurations are COMMITTED (§T0.5) --------------
# .idea/runConfigurations/{csopesy-dev,csopesy-quiz}.xml ARE the graded run configuration and are
# part of the deliverable, so they must stay tracked. customTargets.xml holds the `csopesy-frozen`
# Custom Build Target that csopesy-quiz references by name, so it is part of that configuration too.
.idea/*
!.idea/runConfigurations/
!.idea/customTargets.xml

# --- Local scratch ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
*.swp

